  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v5.3.5: attention fusion fixes for BERT-family models (all-MiniLM-L6-v2 and other sentence-transformers). A real attention mask before the Softmax is no longer fused away as a zero bias; a K transposed in one step from [B,S,H,D] (perm [0,2,3,1]) is fed as K, not with heads and sequence swapped; FusedScaledMatMul never silently skips its scale. MiniLM embeddings now match onnxruntime (related 0.539, unrelated -0.021). SD-Turbo still fuses all 32 attentions. On SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.3.5 + SpawnDev.SpawnJS 3.0.1. Full notes: CHANGELOG.md.",
